--- /dev/null
+++ b/CHANGELOG_BP-055-059.md
@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+# BP-055–BP-059 — WinQuake audio closure
+
+This cumulative block ports and binds WAVE loading, resampling, channel selection, spatialization, signed software mixing, the waveOut ring and CD command behavior. It contains 108 new asset-free fixtures, five C oracles and a two-process evidence test over two stock retail sounds.
+
+Candidate contract: `audio_109_frozen_v1`, fingerprint `0xdcf7a002`.
diff --git a/CHANGELOG_BP-059.md b/CHANGELOG_BP-059.md
