--- /dev/null
+++ b/CHANGELOG_BP-059.md
@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+# BP-059 — audio closure
+
+- freezes the WinQuake 1.09 software-audio contract as `audio_109_frozen_v1`;
+- uses Quake `atoi` semantics for CD play, loop and remap commands;
+- keeps OGG/device modernization as a technical equivalent behind original command state;
+- adds deterministic retail-data evidence for `misc/menu1.wav` and `ambience/water1.wav`;
+- adds 24 closure fixtures and the contract fingerprint `0xdcf7a002`.
